      "content": "wait im not sure i have an epi pen. i mean it doesnt feel that bad yet, just a little uncomfortable. if i take a double dose of benadryl like 50mg or something it should kick in pretty fast right? i really dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's so expensive and i'm mostly fine.",
